@baseUrl = https://localhost:7289
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_PLATFORM_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@headHuntServiceTypeId = REPLACE_WITH_HEADHUNT_COD_SERVICE_TYPE_ID

### MF-01: Platform Admin lists commission rules for the admin screen.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commission-rules?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Filter example: only active HEADHUNT_COD rules at the probation milestone.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commission-rules?serviceTypeId={{headHuntServiceTypeId}}&milestoneType=PROBATION_PASSED&isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### MF-01: Platform Admin creates a probation-based 8 percent commission rule.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commission-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceTypeId": "{{headHuntServiceTypeId}}",
  "milestoneType": "PROBATION_PASSED",
  "rateType": "PERCENT",
  "rateValue": 8,
  "warrantyRequired": false,
  "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-26T00:00:00Z",
  "isActive": true
}

### Expected: 201. Save response data.commissionRuleId for later MF commission-flow tests.
### Expected errors: 400 for inactive/missing Service Type or Milestone and invalid rate;
### 409 when an active rule exists for the same Service Type, Milestone and Effective From.
